    "short_description": "A poker-themed roguelike deckbuilder where strategy meets chaos.",
    "long_description": "Balatro is a unique blend of poker and roguelike elements. Build your deck, collect powerful Jokers, and master the art of hand evaluation in this addictive card game.\n\nFeatures:\n- 20+ unique Jokers with game-changing effects\n- Strategic deckbuilding and hand management\n- Procedurally generated runs for endless replayability\n- Multiple difficulty levels and boss encounters\n- Unlockable content and achievements\n\nPerfect your strategy, beat the odds, and become the ultimate card master!",
